[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":168},"routes/content-page",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"page",{"_15":42,"_21":29,"_17":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_19":50,"_51":52,"_9":53},"related",[11,12,13,14],{"_15":36,"_17":37,"_19":38,"_21":39},{"_15":29,"_17":32,"_19":33,"_21":29},{"_15":26,"_17":27,"_19":28,"_21":29},{"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"slug","book-with-confidence","title","Book with confidence","seo",{"_17":23,"_24":25},"area","company","Book with confidence | holidayfinder","description","Financial protection for package holidays, secure payment, free cancellation on selected hotels, Flex and 24/7 support while you travel.","payment-options","Payment options",{"_17":30,"_24":31},"help","Payment options: deposit, instalments, split | holidayfinder","Pay in full, pay a deposit, pay in 3 instalments at no extra cost or split the payment. Card, PayPal, Apple Pay and Google Pay accepted.","Help Centre",{"_17":34,"_24":35},"Help Centre and FAQ | holidayfinder","Answers about booking, payment plans, changes and cancellations, holidayfinder®Flex, baggage, transfers, car rental and special assistance.","cancellation-policy","Cancellation policy",{"_17":40,"_24":41},"legal","Cancellation policy | holidayfinder","How to cancel a holidayfinder booking, the charges for holidays, hotels, flights, cars, events and cruises, Flex, and how long refunds take.","flex","holidayfinder®Flex","lead","Plans change. With holidayfinder®Flex you can cancel for any reason up to 24 hours before you leave and get 90% of your trip price back.","published","2026-06-15","updated","2026-10-28",{"_17":166,"_24":167},"sections",[54,55,56,57,58,59],[36,29,26,16],{"_60":160,"_17":161,"_93":162,"_63":163},{"_60":151,"_17":152,"_63":153},{"_60":138,"_17":139,"_63":140},{"_60":123,"_17":124,"_63":125},{"_60":91,"_17":92,"_93":94,"_63":95},{"_60":61,"_17":62,"_63":64},"id","faq","Questions about Flex","blocks",[65,66],{"_67":61,"_69":76},{"_67":68,"_69":70},"type","actions","items",[71],{"_72":73,"_74":75},"label","Manage my booking","href","/find-booking",[77,78,79],{"_80":88,"_82":89},{"_80":85,"_82":86},{"_80":81,"_82":83},"question","What if I paid in instalments or with a deposit?","answer",[84],"You get 90% of the trip price back, minus anything not yet paid. Payments still scheduled are cancelled.","Can I cancel for just one traveller?",[87],"Not with Flex: it cancels the whole booking. To remove one traveller, contact us and we’ll check what the airline and hotel allow.","Can I add Flex after booking?",[90],"No. Flex can only be added at checkout, when you book.","what-it-costs","What it costs","intro","Flex costs 10% of the trip price. A few examples:",[96,97],{"_67":101,"_102":103,"_104":105,"_106":107},{"_67":98,"_99":100},"paragraph","text","The exact fee for your trip is shown at checkout before you add Flex.","table","caption","Flex fee and refund examples","columns",[120,121,122],"rows",[108,109,110],[117,118,119],[114,115,116],[111,112,113],"£3,200","£320","£2,880","£1,500","£150","£1,350","£800","£80","£720","Trip price","Flex fee (10%)","Refund if you cancel (90%)","not-covered","What isn’t covered",[126,127],{"_67":133,"_69":134},{"_67":128,"_129":130,"_17":131,"_99":132},"callout","status","warning","Flex is not travel insurance","Flex doesn’t cover medical costs, lost luggage or delays. We recommend you take out travel insurance as well.","list",[135,136,137],"The Flex fee itself and the remaining 10% of the trip price are not refunded.","Flex cancels the whole booking. Single travellers can’t be removed with Flex.","Cancellations less than 24 hours before departure or check-in.","how-to-cancel","How to cancel with Flex",[141,142],{"_67":133,"_144":145,"_69":146},{"_67":98,"_99":143},"You can also cancel with our 24/7 support team. See [Contact us](/info/contact-us).","ordered",true,[147,148,149,150],"Open your trip in [My bookings](/account/bookings), or [find your booking](/find-booking) with your reference and email address.","Choose Cancel booking. You’ll see the amount you get back before you confirm.","Confirm the cancellation. We email you straight away.","Your refund reaches your original payment method within 14 days.","whats-covered","What’s covered",[154],{"_67":133,"_69":155},[156,157,158,159],"**Cancel for any reason**, with no proof or documents needed.","**Up to 24 hours before departure**: before your first flight, or before check-in for stays.","**90% of your trip price back**, refunded to your original payment method within 14 days of cancelling.","**The whole booking**, for everyone travelling.","what-it-is","What Flex is","Flex is an option you add at checkout. It costs 10% of the trip price and lets you cancel the whole booking for any reason.",[164],{"_67":98,"_99":165},"Illness, work, a change of plans: you don’t need to give a reason or send any documents. If you cancel in time, we refund **90% of your trip price** to the payment method you used.","holidayfinder®Flex: cancel for any reason | holidayfinder","Cancel for any reason up to 24 hours before departure and get 90% of your trip price back. How Flex works, what it costs and what it covers.",{"_169":170},"store",{"_60":171,"_172":171,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_19":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_39":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196},"holidayfinder","name","currency","EUR","site",{"_949":950,"_951":952},"engine",{"_945":946,"_947":948},"footer",{"_766":861,"_862":863,"_236":864,"_865":866,"_867":868,"_39":869,"_870":871},"theme",{"_806":807,"_808":809,"_810":811,"_812":813,"_814":815,"_816":817,"_818":819},{"_797":798,"_24":799,"_800":801},"menu",{"_766":767},"preferences",{"_718":719,"_720":721,"_722":723,"_724":174},{"_716":717,"_232":233},"home",{"_217":218,"_219":220,"_221":222,"_223":224,"_225":226,"_227":228},"support",{"_207":208,"_209":210,"_211":212,"_213":214},"paymentMethods",[203,204,205,206],"announcement",{"_197":198,"_199":200},"message","Flexible payment pl